# Laravel Sail Commands

This project runs Laravel through Sail/Docker. Do not run backend commands directly on the host with `php artisan`, `composer`, `vendor/bin/pint`, or `vendor/bin/phpunit`.

Use the root wrapper or Sail binary:

```bash
./sail artisan <command>
./sail composer <command>
./sail test
./sail pint
```

Equivalent long form is allowed:

```bash
./vendor/bin/sail artisan <command>
./vendor/bin/sail composer <command>
```

If a command fails with MySQL host resolution, check whether it was run outside Sail before debugging `.env`.
